  "Perhaps I have created the stars and the sun and this enormous house, but I no longer remember": "Kanske har jag skapat stjärnorna och solen och detta enorma hus, men jag minns det inte längre",
  "Jorge Luis Borges": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "Final workshop presentation": "Workshoppens slutpresentation",
  "Directed by": "Regi",
